          "python",
          "# Pseudocode for stacked training\n# 1. Train first autoencoder\nae1 = Autoencoder(input_dim=784, bottleneck_dim=256)\nae1.fit(X_train)\nfeatures_1 = ae1.encoder.predict(X_train)\n\n# 2. Train second autoencoder on first's bottleneck\nae2 = Autoencoder(input_dim=256, bottleneck_dim=64)\nae2.fit(features_1)\nfeatures_2 = ae2.encoder.predict(features_1)\n\n# 3. Stack: create deep feature learner\ndeep_encoder = Sequential([\n    ae1.encoder,\n    ae2.encoder\n])\n\n# 4. Optional: fine-tune entire stack with labeled data or reconstruction loss"
